1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,195
More: a big red ball, size before colour, never a red big ball.

2
00:00:05,195 --> 00:00:07,226
An old Italian leather jacket.

3
00:00:07,226 --> 00:00:09,218
A small round wooden table.

4
00:00:09,218 --> 00:00:10,546
Two details.

5
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:19,010
Adjectives of the same kind take commas: a cold, wet, miserable morning; adjectives of different kinds take none.

6
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:24,375
And numbers come first: the first three chapters, not the three first.

